    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Geological-form artistic concept: representative three-metre-wide landscape outcrop with broad gently inclined limestone surfaces separated by deep continuous dissolution fissures. Unequal curved joint paths, softened shoulders and common lower rock express clints/grikes rather than industrial tiles, polygon columns or enlarged mud cracks. Nominal depth, spacing, crop thickness and gray palette are art choices, not a measured ancient site. Original biomes cave and scale_class landscape retained; no seawater erosion, mapped coastline, exact age or coexisting habitat claim.",
      "zh": "地质形态艺术概念：三米宽代表性landscape露头，平缓宽岩面之间具有深而连通的溶蚀裂隙。不等宽曲折节理、柔化沟肩与共同下部岩体表达岩块/溶沟，区别于工业地砖、多边岩柱或放大泥裂。沟深、间距、截取厚度及灰色配色为美术设定，不是实测古地点。保留原始biomes cave及scale_class landscape，不主张海水侵蚀、海岸测绘、精确年代或共存生境。"
    },
